==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Just kill the Teacher Bears with [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and other strong cats.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
If you have [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Mitter Saw Cat]] or their evolved form, use it. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] is recommended in Alien stages because of his Freeze ability. Any long rangers, such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]], will help to take out the Teacher Bear if you're having trouble with him.

==='''Chapter 3'''===


This stage is trickier with the mix of enemies you are to deal with in this stage. You must be wary of the Metal and Dark Doges (although the latter not really) and the [[Wave Attack]]s coming from Elizabeth. [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] helps to clear out the Metal Doges, whilst having an [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] should help in protecting the other Cats from Elizabeth's Waves. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can deal damage to the other enemies, though any anti-Alien Cats you may own will work just as well. Cats with [[Wave Shield|Wave Blocker]] or [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]] are to key to killing Elizabeth the LVIth.

